# Environment variables
# .env IS committed on purpose. Lovable builds the live site from the repo, and
# it holds only the public Supabase URL and publishable (anon) key, which ship in
# every browser bundle anyway. Leads are protected by RLS, not by hiding this key.
# Never put a service role key or any real secret in .env. Use .env.local for those.
.env.*
!.env.example

